Suggested human review
1. Open Phase 1's review, choose Changes, and select a web-component TypeScript source such as RelationalUi/Depth2/Elements/Depth1/CompositionButton/index.ts.
2. In Visual, change label and disabled using the node editor; switch to Preview and back.
3. In Code, try an unsaved edit and return to Visual. Check error recovery and use Save when you want to persist the source change.
4. Record feedback in the review before proceeding to Phase 2. Approval remains the user's action.
